Terminals unused in grammar

    CLOSE_COMMENT
    OPEN_COMMENT
    IGNORED
    UNKNOWN
    RANDOM
    AGGRESSIVE
    COMMA
    OPEN_BRACKET
    CLOSE_BRACKET
    EQUAL


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: expression
    2        | boardsim_program

    3 boardsim_program: board_decl
    4                 | cell_decl
    5                 | player_decl
    6                 | dice_decl
    7                 | simulate_block
    8                 | boardsim_program board_decl
    9                 | boardsim_program cell_decl
   10                 | boardsim_program player_decl
   11                 | boardsim_program dice_decl
   12                 | boardsim_program simulate_block

   13 board_decl: BOARD IDENTIFIER LOOP INTEGER SEMICOLON
   14           | BOARD IDENTIFIER GRAPH SEMICOLON

   15 cell_decl: CELL INTEGER STRING_LITERAL SEMICOLON
   16          | CELL INTEGER STRING_LITERAL COST INTEGER SEMICOLON
   17          | CELL INTEGER STRING_LITERAL COST INTEGER RENT INTEGER SEMICOLON

   18 player_decl: PLAYER INTEGER MONEY INTEGER POSITION INTEGER SEMICOLON
   19            | PLAYER INTEGER MONEY INTEGER POSITION INTEGER STRATEGY STRING_LITERAL SEMICOLON

   20 dice_decl: DICE INTEGER SIDES SEMICOLON

   21 simulate_block: SIMULATE INTEGER TURNS OPEN_BRACE CLOSE_BRACE
   22               | SIMULATE INTEGER TURNS OPEN_BRACE statements CLOSE_BRACE

   23 statements: statement
   24           | statements statement

   25 statement: PRINT STRING_LITERAL SEMICOLON
   26          | LOG STRING_LITERAL SEMICOLON
   27          | variable_decl
   28          | if_statement
   29          | loop_statement

   30 if_statement: IF OPEN_PARENTHESIS condition CLOSE_PARENTHESIS THEN OPEN_BRACE statements CLOSE_BRACE
   31             | IF OPEN_PARENTHESIS condition CLOSE_PARENTHESIS THEN OPEN_BRACE statements CLOSE_BRACE ELSE OPEN_BRACE statements CLOSE_BRACE

   32 condition: IDENTIFIER
   33          | INTEGER
   34          | STRING_LITERAL
   35          | comparison_expression

   36 comparison_expression: IDENTIFIER GREATER_THAN INTEGER
   37                      | IDENTIFIER LESS_THAN INTEGER
   38                      | IDENTIFIER GREATER_EQUAL INTEGER
   39                      | IDENTIFIER LESS_EQUAL INTEGER
   40                      | IDENTIFIER EQUALITY INTEGER
   41                      | IDENTIFIER NOT_EQUAL INTEGER

   42 loop_statement: FOR IDENTIFIER IN INTEGER TO INTEGER OPEN_BRACE statements CLOSE_BRACE
   43               | WHILE OPEN_PARENTHESIS condition CLOSE_PARENTHESIS OPEN_BRACE statements CLOSE_BRACE

   44 variable_decl: INT IDENTIFIER EQUALS INTEGER SEMICOLON
   45              | STRING IDENTIFIER EQUALS STRING_LITERAL SEMICOLON
   46              | BOOL IDENTIFIER EQUALS IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON

   47 expression: expression ADD expression
   48           | expression DIV expression
   49           | expression MUL expression
   50           | expression SUB expression
   51           | factor

   52 factor: OPEN_PARENTHESIS expression CLOSE_PARENTHESIS
   53       | constant

   54 constant: INTEGER


